  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "« -도록 » expresses purpose (so that ~) or extent (until ~). For example, « 잘 들리도록 크게 말해요 » (I speak loudly so that it's heard well).",
    "explanation_ko": "'-도록'은 목적(~하도록)이나 정도(~할 때까지)를 나타냅니다. 예: '잘 들리도록 크게 말해요'.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "I speak loudly so that it's heard well.",
        "ko": "잘 들리도록 크게 말해요."
      },
      {
        "en": "I studied until I memorized it.",
        "ko": "외우도록 공부했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "Please write it so that it's easy to understand.",
        "ko": "이해하기 쉽도록 써 주세요."
      }
    ]
  },
